---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CV — Baixin (Max) Guo"
  description="Baixin (Max) Guo — Human-Centered AI, Human-AI Decision Making, and AI Evaluation"
>
  <div class="container-content py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <span class="section-label mb-4">CV</span>
        <h1 class="mb-2">Baixin (Max) Guo</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-3">
          Human-Centered AI · Human-AI Decision Making · AI Evaluation
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">
          <a class="link" href="mailto:gbx1220max@gmail.com">gbx1220max@gmail.com</a>
          <a class="link" href="https://github.com/GBX-Max1220" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          <span>China · Remote availability from Oct 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-3">Canonical web CV · Updated September 2026</p>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-[1.3rem] mb-4">Research Profile</h2>
        <div class="card-static">
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
            Recent Applied Psychology graduate transitioning toward CS and human-centered AI. I build and evaluate systems that help people make appropriately calibrated decisions with AI agents, using systems development, rigorous evaluation, measurement, and experiment design.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-[1.3rem] mb-4">Research and Technical Experience</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="card-static">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap mb-2">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Trojan Sports Research Lab, USC Marshall School of Business</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Research collaboration · Supervisor: Prof. Lorena Martin</p>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Mar 2025 – Mar 2026</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Collected, cleaned, visualized, and analyzed multi-source baseball data for research on pitcher workload, pitch characteristics, and injury risk.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-static">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap mb-2">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">CheckMyCoach — Human-Centered AI Decision-Support Prototype</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">2026</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Built an offline prototype and diagnostic pipeline that flags unsupported high-confidence AI advice, routes claims to evidence or repair, and exports structured evaluation records.</li>
              <li>Specified evaluation boundaries for routing, conditional revision, preservation, and end-to-end behavior; completed 82/82 engineering dry-run checks. Human-participant data have not yet been collected.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-static">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap mb-2">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Undergraduate Thesis — Evaluating Chinese LLMs on CBT-Bench</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">2026</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Designed a fixed zero-shot evaluation across five Chinese LLM services on 442 structured CBT-Bench examples; implemented batch API execution with checkpointing and retry logic.</li>
              <li>Reported exact match, partial-overlap, and sample-average F1 metrics; treated findings as benchmark evidence, not clinical validation or human-outcome evidence.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-static">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap mb-2">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">AI Evaluation and Evidence Infrastructure</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">2026</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Conducted a Stage 0 reproducibility and feasibility audit of official SummEval annotations and G-Eval results across 1,600 item-system pairs, checking IDs, alignment, missingness, parser behavior, and provenance.</li>
              <li>Designed typed interaction and session schemas for recording AI advice exposure, verification, revision, override, failure, and recovery states.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-[1.3rem] mb-4">Education</h2>
        <div class="card-static">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Changchun Humanities and Sciences College</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mt-1">Bachelor’s degree in Applied Psychology</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">2022 – 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[1.3rem] mb-4">Methods and Technical Skills</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="card-static">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Research</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">Experimental design; psychometrics and measurement; behavioral study design; inter-rater reliability; statistical analysis</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-static">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Programming & Data</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">Python; JavaScript/TypeScript; Git/GitHub; data pipelines; data analysis; data visualization; basic SQL/SQLite</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-static sm:col-span-2">
            <h3 class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-gold)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">AI Evaluation</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">LLM/API research pipelines; LLM evaluation; agent prototyping; supervised machine-learning workflows</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
